  "system": {
    "biography": "<p>The Hive's heaviest printed guardian: Quickness and Strength 9, Armour 5/5, hitting at 11M with Paralyzing Touch and Venom. Printed Reaction 10 (15).</p><p><strong>Manual rules the sheet does not enforce.</strong> Powers and Weaknesses are not fields on the NPC data model, so they live here as prose. Switching these to <code>spirit</code> actors would be worse — <code>SpiritData.prepareDerivedData</code> recomputes attributes from Force and would overwrite the printed table this whole audit exists to restore.</p><p><strong>Astral:</strong> add <strong>+5 Initiative</strong> when acting astrally (the printed Reaction shows this as the bracketed second value). It is deliberately NOT baked into <code>reaction</code>, which would also inflate dodge and defence.</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> 11M Physical + Special (printed SR1 <code>9M2</code>, converted by p.283 method B — no SR2 item is an ant's mandibles, so the staging digit folds into Power).</p><p><strong>Powers:</strong> Enhanced Senses (Smell), Manifestation, Paralyzing Touch, Venom.<br><strong>Weaknesses:</strong> Reduced Senses (Sight), Vulnerability (Insecticide).</p><p><em>Queen Euphoria p.52, transcribed from a 300 dpi render.</em></p>",
